## Camel Integration Capability {{projectVersion}} is available

This release is ready to download and evaluate. Check the release page for its release status and notes.

Camel Integration Capability is a capability service for the Wanaku Governed Action Proxy (formerly known as Wanaku MCP Router)
that provides [Apache Camel](https://camel.apache.org) route execution capabilities.

